Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `ExpiringSecret.new` wants `Clock` for argument 3, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/secrets_expiry/expiring_secret_rejects_non_clock_observers_in_sema.jet:10:45
    |
 10 |     _ := vault.ExpiringSecret.new(key, ttl, 42)
    |                                             ^^
 Why: Secret expiry must observe the explicitly injected clock
 Fix: Use `Clock.new(...)` for deterministic code or `Clock.system()` for production
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
